			"gloss": "<i>He</i>, the fifth letter of the Alphabet.—It interchanges dialectically with <cite ref=\"A00000\"><he>א</he></cite> as <cite ref=\"D00140\"><he>דָּה</he></cite> a. <cite ref=\"D00003\"><he>דָּא</he></cite>, <cite ref=\"E00347\"><he>הֵידֵיין</he></cite> a. <cite ref=\"A01161\"><he>אֵידֵין</he></cite>, <cite ref=\"E00058\"><he>הַגָּדָה</he></cite> a. <cite ref=\"A00247\"><he>אַגָּדָה</he></cite> &c.; with <cite ref=\"H00000\"><he>ח</he></cite> as <cite ref=\"D00154\"><he>דְּהַךְ</he></cite> a. <cite ref=\"D00410\"><he>דְּחַךְ</he></cite>, <cite ref=\"C00255\"><he>גָּהָה</he></cite> a. <cite ref=\"C00584\"><he>גָּחָה</he></cite> &c.; with <cite ref=\"F00000\"><he>ו</he></cite> as <cite ref=\"B00177\"><he>בְּהֵית</he></cite> a. <cite ref=\"B00394\"><he>בּוֹשׁ</he></cite>, <cite ref=\"T00278\"><he>רְהַט</he></cite> a. <cite ref=\"T00427\"><he>רוּץ</he></cite> &c.—<cite ref=\"E00000\"><he>ה</he></cite> a formative prefix of verbal nouns, e.g. <cite ref=\"E00709\"><he>הֶסְפֵּד</he></cite>, <cite ref=\"E00237\"><he>הוֹלָכָה</he></cite> &c.",
			"units": []
